flowchart TD
    Start([Install]) --> Lock[Acquire apm.lock]
    Lock --> Recover[Recover shared journal]
    Recover --> Refresh[RefreshInstalled + 选择目标 Agent]
    Refresh --> ExactPlugin{显式规范 Plugin ref 且全部 manifest 精确命中?}
    ExactPlugin -->|是| Unchanged[全部 unchanged；零 catalog 调用] --> Release
    ExactPlugin -->|否| Snapshot[CatalogManager.SnapshotLocked；不二次加锁]
    Snapshot --> Sync[加载本地 catalog；检查 version；必要时下载并原子替换]
    Sync -->|provider/update 失败且旧快照有效| Stale[一次 stale warning]
    Sync -->|无有效快照、取消或本地安全失败| Fatal[返回 fatal error]
    Sync -->|current 或 updated| Resolve[Snapshot.Resolve 得到精确 CatalogEntry]
    Stale --> Resolve
    Resolve --> AgentLoop{下一个 Agent}
    AgentLoop --> Type{entry.Ref.Type}

    Type -->|Skill| SkillFact[ResolveSkill + manifest fact]
    SkillFact -->|同版本| Unchanged
    SkillFact -->|变更| SkillCache[PrepareSkill entry；hit 复验，miss 完整透传 entry 下载]
    SkillCache --> SkillTx[filesystem Install transaction]

    Type -->|Agent| AgentFact[ResolveAgent + manifest fact]
    AgentFact -->|同版本| Unchanged
    AgentFact -->|变更| AgentCache[PrepareAgent entry；hit/miss 均校验完整 Agent 目录]
    AgentCache --> AgentTx[filesystem InstallAgent transaction]

    Type -->|MCP| MCPFact[ResolveMCP + manifest + CLI Inspect]
    MCPFact -->|同版本且 present| Unchanged
    MCPFact -->|unmanaged present| BusinessFail[fail closed]
    MCPFact -->|首装或目标版本| MCPGet[GetMCP target CatalogEntry]
    MCPFact -->|版本切换| Previous[同一 Snapshot.Metadata previous Ref] --> MCPPrevious[GetMCP previous CatalogEntry] --> MCPGet
    MCPGet --> MCPTx[agent-cli InstallMCP；安装 journal 保留新旧 definition]

    Type -->|Plugin| PluginFact[ResolvePlugin + manifest/Agent facts]
    PluginFact -->|同版本| Unchanged
    PluginFact -->|冲突或损坏| BusinessFail
    PluginFact -->|可安装| PluginEnsure[Ensure target CatalogEntry；miss 完整透传 entry 下载 canonical package]
    PluginEnsure --> PluginMode{marketplace 或 filesystem}
    PluginMode -->|Codex / Claude| Marketplace[验证共享 artifact 与 marketplace；按事实首装、retained 重装或版本切换]
    PluginMode -->|Hermes / Bibit| Filesystem[StageFilesystem target Ref]
    Marketplace --> PluginTx[plugin transaction]
    Filesystem --> PluginTx

    SkillTx --> Outcome[installed/upgraded/downgraded]
    AgentTx --> Outcome
    MCPTx --> Outcome
    PluginTx --> Outcome
    Unchanged --> AgentLoop
    Outcome --> AgentLoop
    BusinessFail --> Batch[当前 failed；剩余 unexecuted]
    AgentLoop -->|完成| Release[Release 后才渲染]
    Batch --> Release
    Fatal --> ReleaseError[Release 并返回 fatal；不渲染业务行]
